# Note Templates

> **For future Claude**: This directory contains Templater-compatible note templates. Never modify templates during normal vault operations.

## Available Templates
- `Daily Note.md` - Template for daily notes
- `Project.md` - Template for project notes
- `Person.md` - Template for person notes
- `Task.md` - Template for task notes
- `Meeting.md` - Template for meeting notes
- `Decision.md` - Template for decision records
- `Research.md` - Template for research notes

## Rules
- Templates are read-only during normal operations
- Use `/create-command` to create new templates
- Templates follow AI-first rules (preamble, frontmatter, etc.)
